'''Clan''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It has a black blade with what appears to be a purple Chinese symbol imprinted on it, alongside the silver edge. The guard is golden, and the handle is black with purple stains on it.

== Trivia ==
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/21464308/profile PrimeFIRE94] is the creator of this knife.
*The original name of this knife was "DarkAge Knife"
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games.
*The description of this knife is: "The shadows are your friend, especially the light switch...."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/162671122/SKIN-DarkAge-Knife Model created by PrimeFIRE94]</ref>

